We are in the new flat.
My big suitcase is very heavy.
I put the suitcase down on the floor.
It is kept near the door.
Asha comes inside.
My small bag is in her hand.
Asha puts the small bag down.
That small bag is kept near the suitcase.
Now my luggage is on the floor.
It is kept near the door.
Asha looks in the room.
She looks at me.
She smiles nicely.
Asha says, "Maya, there is no hurry."
"We have a lot of time."
"You are in your home now."
I say yes to Asha.
I look at the suitcase.
I feel very calm.
